 of the quest is not fixed and adjusted in real time according to the value of the fish caught.<br>You completed the same quest and caught a fish of high value? Of course, you need to get more rewards!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1904040/extras/74402d7a669c68b1dd0d551e5230fc48.avif?t=1783679315\" width=320 height=350 /></span>", "short_description": "Welcome to Fantasy Fishing Town!Embark on a journey to catch various fish and complete quests to find the legendary fish. Enjoy the unique pleasure of pixel graphics and side-scrolling fishing!The legendary fish - it's mine!", "supported_languages": "English, Japanese, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese, Korean", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1904040/61189e6f749c4511cd604a908a366bfcff41cf8d/header.jpg?t=1783679315", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1904040/a4cfaa95cd5f613f2e4ae3ddd2b80c75e31853a5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1783679315", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1904040/a4cfaa95cd5f613f2e4ae3ddd2b80c75e31853a5/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1783679315", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i3 or better<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 512 MB VRAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 512 MB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Minimum screen resolution 1280x720</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> The more cores th